    "text": "ON \u00feA HALGAN \u00feUNRES DEI.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, magon we nu hwylcum hwego wordum secgan be \u00fe\u00e6re arwyr\u00fenesse \u00feisse halgan tide\nW\u00e6s on \u00feyssum d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten H\u00e6lend Crist \u00fea menniscan gecynd \u00fee he genam to his\n\u00deonne gehyrdon we \u00e6r on \u00feas halgan tide secgan be \u00fe\u00e6re halgan \u00ferowunga ures Drihtenes, & eac be his\n\u00deonne sceolon we nu hwylcum hwego wordum secggan be \u00feisse halgan drihtenlican upastigennesse, \u00fea\nSaga\u00f0 Sanctus Lucas, se godspellere, \u00feissum wordum be \u00feon & \u00feus cwy\u00fe: Igitur qui conuenerant usque\n\u00dea halwendan men cw\u00e6don, & \u00fea geleafsuman, \u00fee \u00fee to urum Drihtne coman \u00fea he to heofonum\nHe \u00fea Drihten Crist \u00e6r his \u00feam halgum \u00e6teowde \u00e6fter his \u00e6riste, & him spr\u00e6c to, & s\u00e6gde ymb godes\nAc n\u00e6ron hie \u00feagyt \u00fea halgan mid \u00feon godcundan gaste swa getrymede, swa hie sona emb ten niht\nAhsodan \u00fea for\u00feon hwe\u00f0er he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t rice sona her on eor\u00fean gesettan \u00fee \u00feonne \u00feisse worlde ende\n\u00dea ondswarede he Drihten, & him cy\u00fede, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe, Non est uestrum usque ad potestatem; Nis \u00fe\u00e6t\nWe leornia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t seo tid sie to\u00fe\u00e6s degol \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6re n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nig to\u00fe\u00e6s halig mon on \u00feissum\nWe witon \u00feonne hwe\u00fere \u00fe\u00e6t hit nis no feor to \u00feon; for\u00feon \u00fee ealle \u00fea tacno & \u00fea forebeacno \u00fea \u00fee her\nNis \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne feor to\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t eac geweor\u00fean sceal; for\u00feon \u00fees middangeard nede on \u00f0as eldo\nFif elddo sindon ahgan.\nOn \u00feam syxtan sceal beon dom deih.\n\u00deonne sceal \u00fees middangeard endian on \u00feam sixta elddo & \u00feisse is \u00feonne se m\u00e6sta d\u00e6l agangen, efne\nNe w\u00e6ron \u00feas ealle gelice lange, ac on \u00feyssum w\u00e6s \u00fereo \u00feusend wintra, on sumre l\u00e6sse, on sumere eft\nNis for\u00feon n\u00e6nig mon \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t an wite hu lange he ure Drihten \u00feas gedon wille, hw\u00e6\u00feer \u00feis \u00feusend\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6ghwylcum men swi\u00fee uncu\u00fe, buton urum Drihtne anum.\n\u00dea he \u00fea ure Drihten his \u00fe\u00e6m halgum s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t heora gemet n\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6t wiston, hwonne he\nHw\u00e6t we witon & leornia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fee teo\u00fean d\u00e6ge him \u00feone Halgan Gast onsende of heofonum, \u00fee hie\n& hie seo\u00fe\u00fean ealle worlde wean & ealle \u00fereatas oforhogodan, & him nowiht fore ne ondredon; for\u00feon\nHeora modes heanesse ealle eor\u00fecyningas ofercuman onbegan mihton.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe he, Et eritis mihi testes in Hierusalem et omni Iudea et Samaria et usque ad ultimum terre; He\nHw\u00e6s sceoldan hie \u00fea halgan urum Drihtne gewitan beon, buton \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6t sceoldan mancynne cy\u00fean\n\u00de\u00e6t he sylfa us hider on middangeard gesecean wolde, mid lufan & mid ea\u00femodnesse, on menniscne\n& \u00fea bysena \u00fee hie \u00e6t his d\u00e6dum gesawon, \u00fea hie sceoldan eac mannum cy\u00fean, & his \u00fea halgan\n\u00de\u00e6t hie ealle heora sylfra eagon oforsegon & heora earon gehyrdon, \u00feyses ealles hie sceoldon Drihtne\nSwa we leornia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t sona \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee Drihten on heofenas astag, & hie mid Halgan Gaste getrymede\n& \u00e6ghwylc anra heora in \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6le \u00fee he mid tan geeode, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feurh Godes gife manige \u00feeode urum\nHec cum dixisset usque ad eorum et cetera.\nNalas \u00fe\u00e6t wolcn \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fey for\u00fe com \u00fee ure Drihten \u00fe\u00e6s wolcnes fultomes \u00feearfe h\u00e6fde \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re\n& ealle \u00feurh his godcunde meht & \u00feurh his ecean snyttro \u00e6fter his willan rece\u00fe & stihta\u00fe.\n& he mid \u00fey tacne swa on \u00fe\u00e6m wolcne from heora gesih\u00fee gewat, & in heofenas astag, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feonne\nCumque inturent usque albis.\n\u00dea hie \u00fea in \u00feone heofon locodan \u00e6fter him, & hie Drihten gesawon upastigendne, \u00fea stodan him\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ron Drihtnes englas.\n\u00dea hwitan hr\u00e6gl \u00feara engla getacnia\u00fe \u00feone gefean engla & manna, \u00fee \u00fea geworden w\u00e6s.\nFor\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t englas on heofenum maran gefean & maran blisse h\u00e6fdon \u00feonne hie\n\u00deonne w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feas halgan tid geworden \u00fea hie \u00feonc heora Scyppend gesegon, & \u00feone so\u00fean\n& him \u00fea w\u00e6s eac heora gefea & heora blis geeced \u00fea hie wiston \u00fe\u00e6t heora e\u00feel \u00fe\u00e6r on heofenum\nHw\u00e6t we witon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwylcum men bi\u00fe leofre swa he h\u00e6bbe holdra freonda ma.\nOnd nu \u00feeos halige tid englum \u00feus healice to gefean & to blisse wear\u00fe, hw\u00e6t \u00feonne huru eallunga seo\nFor\u00feon se hindsi\u00f0 mancynnes & \u00fe\u00e6t heaflice gewrit \u00fe\u00e6t wear\u00f0 \u00feys d\u00e6ge fordilegod, & se sarlica\nOn \u00fea ilcan menniscan gecynd \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6r \u00feurh eornesse swa tocw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fea ilcan he ure Drihten on \u00feas\nHu mihte \u00e6fre englum mara gefea & geofu & blis geweor\u00fean, o\u00fe\u00fee mannum mara weor\u00f0mynd \u00feonne\n\u00de\u00e6s we sceolan nu simle unablinnendlice mid ealre heortan meagolmodnesse urum Drihtne \u00feanc\n\u00dea hy \u00fea up on \u00feone heofon \u00e6fter urum Drihtne locodan, swa ic \u00e6r s\u00e6gde, \u00fea cw\u00e6don \u00fea englas to\n\u00dees H\u00e6lend \u00fee nu up on \u00feysne heofon from eow astag, o\u00fe\u00fee ahafen w\u00e6s, he eft cyme\u00fe on domes d\u00e6g\nSwa he ure Drihten eft cyme\u00fe on domes d\u00e6g in wolcne & in \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan lichoman, \u00fee he nu on\nAh \u00feonne hw\u00e6\u00feere he wile cuman mid mycle maran egsan.\nFor\u00feon \u00fee se ilca Drihten \u00fee us nu \u00e6r mid ealre ea\u00femodnesse hider on middangeard gesohte in\n& he wile his \u00fea halgan & \u00fea gecorenan mid him gel\u00e6dan on his \u00fe\u00e6t heofonlice rice.\nSwa he wile \u00feonne eac ealle deofles men, \u00fee nu \u00e6r her on worlde synt & mand\u00e6da fremedon, \u00fea he\nAh wuton we \u00fe\u00e6t nu geornlice gemunan \u00fea hwile \u00fee we magon & motan.\nUton betan \u00fea geworhtan synna & \u00e6lmihtigne Drihten georne biddan \u00fe\u00e6t he us gescylde wi\u00f0 \u00fea\n& uton we symle \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges fyrhto & egsan on ure mod settan.\nUton gemunan hu uncu\u00fe bi\u00f0 \u00e6ghwylcum anum men his lifes tid, \u00e6ghwe\u00feer ge ricum ge heanum, ge\nGeseo we \u00fe\u00e6t oft swi\u00fee manegum men f\u00e6rlice gelimpe\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he hine wi\u00f0 \u00feas world ged\u00e6le\u00fe; for\u00feon\nSwylce eac we leornia\u00fe, men, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea men secga\u00fe \u00fea \u00fee \u00feyder ferdon & eft hider coman, \u00fe\u00e6t seo stow\n\u00deonne leornia\u00fe we \u00fe\u00e6t seo stow is on Oliuetes dune ufeweardre; \u00feonne is \u00fe\u00e6re swi\u00f0e mycel cyrice &\n\u00deonne synd \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fery porticas emb \u00fea ciricean utan geworhte, & \u00fea ealle swi\u00fee f\u00e6gere ufan oferworhte\nSeo myccle cirice \u00feonne, seo \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r on middum stonde\u00fe, seo is ufan open & unoferhrefed, for\u00feon he\n& \u00feeah \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t hus ufan open sy sylf & unoferhrefed, swa ic \u00e6r s\u00e6gde, hwe\u00fere hit bi\u00fe a \u00feurh Godes\n& seo\u00fe\u00fean \u00feis hus o\u00fe\u00fee seo stow \u00fe\u00e6r getimbred w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t seo\u00fe\u00fean n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nig man \u00fea l\u00e6stas sylfe\nAc swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00fe\u00e6r man on alegde \u00feonne wearp seo eor\u00fee hit sona sylf up of hire to \u00fe\u00e6s mannes\n\u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00fe\u00e6re myclan ciricean geworht emb \u00fea lastas utan, hwene widdre \u00feonne bydenf\u00e6t, up\nW\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6reste of grenum are geworht; nu hit is mid golde & mid seolfre gefr\u00e6twod.\nIs \u00feonne on westan medmycel duru \u00fe\u00e6t mannes heafod ge \u00fea sculdro magan in, \u00fe\u00e6t man m\u00e6g to \u00fe\u00e6m\n& manige men \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea moldan neoma\u00fe on \u00fe\u00e6m lastum, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t begytan magan \u00fe\u00e6t hie hit don motan,\n& \u00feonne is \u00fe\u00e6t eac ealles wundorlicost \u00fe\u00e6t man d\u00e6ghwamlice \u00fea moldan nime\u00fe on \u00fe\u00e6m lastum, &\nAh hie a swa onwalge beo\u00fe & on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan onsyne \u00fee hie \u00fe\u00e6r on forman on \u00fea eor\u00fean bestapene\nForlet he ure Drihten his \u00fea halgan fet \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00fea eor\u00fean besincan mannum to ecre gemynde, \u00fea he\n& swa nuget on \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00fean \u00fea stoplas ona\u00ferycte syndon o\u00fe \u00feysne andweardan d\u00e6g, \u00feurh \u00fea heora\n\u00deonne hanga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r eac bufan \u00fe\u00e6m lastum geregnod swi\u00fee mycel leohtf\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t man simle mid ele\nSwylce eac syndon on \u00fe\u00e6re myclan cirican \u00fee ymb \u00fea stowe utan geworht is, ehta eag\u00feyrelu swi\u00fee\n& to \u00feon leohte & beorhte scina\u00fe \u00e6lce niht \u00feurh \u00fea eag\u00feyrelo, swa swa eles gecynd bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he\n& \u00fe\u00e6t oft gita manegum mannum gelimpe\u00fe, \u00feonne hie \u00fe\u00e6t leoht geseo\u00fe on niht scinan swa beorhte,\n& hie eft f\u00e6ringa \u00fee maran hreowe do\u00fe heora synna, \u00feonne hie gemuna\u00fe \u00fea mycclan ea\u00femodnesse, &\n& \u00fe\u00e6t ealra m\u00e6st w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he for ealles mancynnes h\u00e6le mid his sylfes willan dea\u00fe ge\u00ferowode, \u00feeah\n& hu he eft \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge of dea\u00fee aras, & \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe nehst lichomlice on stod her on\n\u00deonne hie \u00fe\u00e6t eall gemunan & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t leoht gemanode beo\u00fe, \u00fee hie of \u00fe\u00e6re halgan stowe scinan\n& \u00f0\u00e6t is \u00feonne geare to witenne \u00feonne God heora heortan swa innan mana\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t he him \u00feonne wille\nOnd nu, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feeah \u00fee we nu \u00fe\u00e6r andwearde ne syn \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re halgan stowe \u00fee ic nu s\u00e6gde,\nFor \u00feon \u00e6ghwylc man, sy \u00fe\u00e6r eor\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6r he sy, \u00feurh gode d\u00e6da Gode lician sceal, & \u00e6lc man sceal\nAc uton teolian \u00fe\u00e6t us \u00feas tida idle ne gewitan, \u00fee he ure Drihten us to bote & to cl\u00e6nsunga urra d\u00e6da\nUton beon \u00e6lmesgeorne & ard\u00e6de wi\u00f0 earme men, & ea\u00femode us betweonan, & Godes ege & his lufe\n& teolian we \u00feonne \u00feeos halige tid eft cume embe twelf mona\u00fe, \u00fee se lifge \u00fe\u00e6t he betre sy \u00feonne he",
